Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Andrew,

probably you're looking for free scales. You can set them
with scales = "free", resp. scales = "free_x". You can find
an example in http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggplot2/ggplot2.pdf
chapter facet_grid (page 23).

/johannes

