Subject: Re: Suggestion: use stat_identity as default for geom_bar
Message-ID: <9LVx0Ca2AGM.M1RZy9rD35kJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <9LVx0Ca2AGM.DCOALwJg_ngJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
